{"4855810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Towers to Be", "steam_appid": 4855810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration platformer about using unorthodox methods to help someone remember their own strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your moves to jump across the world, uncover memories, and make your way through the illusions of a mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Towers to Climb</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through the world by going upwards. Use your moveset and the world around you to go up, up, and away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memories of the Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story behind this brain through dreamlike worlds and platforming challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Lies Beyond..?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road you will take should be pretty paved, but there may be something else hidden deeper in the mind...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's important to keep in mind that you can't just reach the top.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game may contain flashing imagery that is not suitable for all players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration platformer about using unorthodox methods to help someone remember their own strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your moves to jump across the world, uncover memories, and make your way through the illusions of a mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Towers to Climb</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through the world by going upwards. Use your moveset and the world around you to go up, up, and away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memories of the Mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story behind this brain through dreamlike worlds and platforming challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Lies Beyond..?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road you will take should be pretty paved, but there may be something else hidden deeper in the mind...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's important to keep in mind that you can't just reach the top.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game may contain flashing imagery that is not suitable for all players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Platform and zoom around a dream-like world to discover what happened to the mind of this patient.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855810/d8e09f40ca585f12f9c627743543000c4691e332/header.jpg?t=1783697619", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855810/fedd7e20306c8050a7b29597706408fad76bfd85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783697619", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855810/fedd7e20306c8050a7b29597706408fad76bfd85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783697619", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU with SSE2 instructions, any x86_64 CPU, ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Full Vulkan Support Required<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU with SSE4.2 instructions, with 4 physical cores or more, ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><stron